21981 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 21982 0 R/Alt(Timing diagram over four clock periods with five rows: clk, en, gclk of an AND gate, the latched enable, and gclk of the ICG. en rises shortly after the second rising edge and falls shortly after the fourth. The AND output rises late inside the high phase of the second period, has a complete pulse in the third, and only a short pulse at the start of the fourth, marked late edge and short pulse. The latched enable rises at the falling edge of the second period and falls at the falling edge of the fourth. The ICG output has complete clock pulses in the third and the fourth period only.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31383 0 R>>
endobj
