<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 24906 0 R/Alt(Gate-level circuit with inputs a, b and c on the left. Input a drives the AND gate u_ab and, through the inverter u_inv, the net a_n, which drives the AND gate u_anc. Input b drives u_ab and the AND gate u_bc. Input c drives u_anc and u_bc. The outputs ab, anc and bc of the three AND gates drive the three inputs of the OR gate u_or, whose output is y_o. The gate u_bc and its output are drawn in orange.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[85]/Pg 31418 0 R>>
